        "id": "thm-ores-hamiltonicity-theorem",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Ore's theorem: an $n$-vertex graph with $n\\ge3$ and $\\deg(u)+\\deg(v)\\ge n$ for every nonadjacent pair is Hamiltonian",
